*.tsbuildinfo
next-env.d.ts
venv/

# Local documentation (not to be pushed)
/docs/local/
**/LOCAL_*.md
**/IMPLEMENTATION_*.md
**/DRAFT_*.md
WORK-SUMMARY.md
IMPLEMENTATION-PLAN.md
IMPLEMENTATION-SUMMARY.md
BUILD-IN-PUBLIC-TRANSPARENCY.md

# Service-specific docs (keep READMEs, ignore internal docs)
services/**/*_NOTES.md
services/**/*_TODO.md
services/**/*_DRAFT.md
